# Architecture

```
src/data/                 content only
src/components/layout/    banner, header, footer, sticky call bar
src/components/home/      homepage sections
src/components/shared/    cards, form, headings
src/views/                one file per route
src/router/index.js       history + BASE_URL
```

Routes: `/` Home, `/services`, `/team`, `/visit`. Router uses `import.meta.env.BASE_URL`.

`App.vue` shell: ConceptBanner → AppHeader → RouterView → AppFooter → StickyCallBar. Main `pb-28` on small screens.

Import practice/doctors/services/nav from `src/data/`. `RequestVisitForm` is client-side only (success state, no POST). Featured home services = `featured: true` in `src/data/services.js`.
